{"title":"보스 인 스쿨 시즌 3","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dHqqbQ/hzXatpLD0J/XKPd3kRxCrseozz8o2USWk&filename=th3","synopsis":"태어날 때부터 싸움에 천부적인 재능을 가졌던 주인공 강세현.\n\n초등학교 시절 중학생 무리와의 싸움으로 경찰서를 가게 되었고,\n그 계기로 인해 두번다시는 싸움을 하지 않기로 어머니와 약속을 한다.\n어머니와의 약속 때문에 묵묵히 학교생활을 보내던 어느 날..\n\n조직 <썬샤인>의 보스였던 아버지가 죽게되면서 갑작스럽게 조직을 이어받게 된다.\n\n어린 나이에  조직의 회장이 된 세현은 수많은 강적들을 물리치며 아버지 죽음에 대한 진실에 다가서게 되는데.. \n\n\n“조직 <썬샤인> 보스 강세현의 고교 액션활극\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":26,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":19,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":18,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":24,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":31,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":26,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":22,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":24,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":25,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":28,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":24,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":25,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":28,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":21,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":21,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":30,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":26,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":31,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":13,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":15,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":18,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":151,"change":{"type":"down","amount":133}},{"date":"2026-08-31